  "label": "Stereotype linking poor diet to moral decay",
  "description": "The meme implies that poor dietary choices (e.g., eating unhealthy, processed, or excessive amounts of food) lead to moral and physical degeneration. This is a common cultural trope that equates physical appearance or health with moral character — a stereotype that is not visible in the image but is necessary to interpret the meme’s message.",
